  era: "Section 38 \xB7 Historiography \xB7 How we know the past"
  title: Contemporary interpretations
  text: Historians today use many methods, from ancient DNA and environmental history to gender, caste and regional studies and digital archives. Debates continue, and history remains a living conversation about evidence.
